          "type": "text",
          "text": "The curved surface of a traffic cone is painted orange. The cone has radius 7 cm and slant height 24 cm. Find its curved surface area in cm², correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 2,
      "primary_outcome": "5.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
